1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,795
M: I heard we're going to be sending some employees to the trade fair next week.

2
00:00:04,525 --> 00:00:04,995
W: That's right.

3
00:00:05,575 --> 00:00:11,355
Mr. Wilson decided to rent a booth since so many international firms will be represented there.

4
00:00:12,255 --> 00:00:13,135
M: I'd love to go.

5
00:00:13,855 --> 00:00:17,790
I've been to several trade fairs in the past, so I'm familiar with what happens at them.

6
00:00:18,495 --> 00:00:22,870
W: You'd better drop by his department and talk to him soon in that case.

7
00:00:23,315 --> 00:00:26,655
All attendees must be registered by the end of the day tomorrow.

8
00:00:27,695 --> 00:00:28,995
M: I wasn't aware of that.

9
00:00:29,095 --> 00:00:30,030
Thanks for letting me know.

10
00:00:30,575 --> 00:00:31,475
W: No problem.
